# The frozen legacy pipeline (scripts/capture-golden-baseline.mjs) still
# writes REAL licensed pixels straight from assets-src/ to these vendor-named
# paths (see .gitignore) — gitignored, so `git archive` never ships them, but
# a Docker build context reads the working tree directly. Verified: without
# this rule a stray `npm run golden:capture` residue on disk gets COPIed
# straight into the image (I-12).
